{{!
    @template mod_mylkpd/worksheet

    The worksheet: toolbar (when it can be edited), the pages and the credit line. The JavaScript module
    mod_mylkpd/worksheet reads its settings from data-mylkpd-config.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * toolbar - toolbar context, or false when read-only
    * namestoggle - label of the names switch for a read-only group worksheet, or empty
    * classes - classes of the page container
    * config - settings for the JavaScript (JSON)
    * credit - credit line

    Example context (json):
    {"toolbar": false, "namestoggle": "", "classes": "mylkpd-container mylkpd-mode-view", "config": "{}",
     "credit": "MyLKPD 1.4.0 · made by Zalira"}
}}
{{#toolbar}}{{> mod_mylkpd/toolbar}}{{/toolbar}}
{{^toolbar}}{{#namestoggle}}<div class="mylkpd-teambar">{{> mod_mylkpd/names_toggle}}</div>{{/namestoggle}}{{/toolbar}}
<div id="mylkpd-container" class="{{classes}}" data-mylkpd-config="{{config}}"></div>
<div class="mylkpd-credit" data-mylkpd-credit="zalira">{{credit}}</div>
